// Description: Detects suspicious PowerShell download command
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

any where (((ContextInfo like "*_.DownloadFile(*" or ContextInfo like "*_.DownloadString(*")) and (ContextInfo like "*_System.Net.WebClient*"))
